資本支出提高至 865-8.9 億美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/75677/000119312526074129/pkg-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Packaging Corporation of America (\"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"PCA,\" or the \"Company\") is the third largest producer of containerboard products and a leading producer of uncoated freesheet (UFS) paper in North America. We operate ten mills and 91 corrugated products plants and related facilities. We are headquartered in Lake Forest, Illinois and operate in the United States.","zh":"美國包裝公司（「我們」、「我們的」、「PCA」或「公司」）是北美第三大箱板紙產品生產商和領先的無塗層自由紙 (UFS) 生產商。我們經營 10 家工廠和 91 家瓦楞紙製品廠及相關設施。我們的總部位於伊利諾州森林湖，並在美國開展業務。"},{"en":"We report in three reportable segments: Packaging, Paper and Corporate and Other. For segment financial information see Note 19, Segment Information, of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements in \"Part II, Item 8, Financial Statements and Supplementary Data\" of this Form 10-K.","zh":"我們分為三個可報告部門進行報告：包裝、造紙、企業和其他。有關分部財務資訊，請參閱本表 10-K「第二部分第 8 項財務報表和補充數據」中合併財務報表附註的附註 19「分部資訊」。"},{"en":"On September 2, 2025, we completed the acquisition of the containerboard business of Greif, Inc. (\"Greif\" or \"Greif Acquisition\") for $1.8 billion in cash. The Greif containerboard business includes two containerboard mills with approximately 800,000 tons of production capacity and eight sheet feeder and corrugated plants located across the United States. The operating results of Greif Acquisition are included in PCA's results in the Packaging segment after the date of acquisition.","zh":"2025 年 9 月 2 日，我們以 18 億美元現金完成了對 Greif, Inc. 箱板紙業務的收購（「Greif」或「Greif Acquisition」）。格瑞夫箱板紙業務包括兩家產能約 80 萬噸的箱板紙工廠以及位於美國各地的八家送紙機和瓦楞紙工廠。 Greif 收購的營運表現包含在收購日期後 PCA 包裝部門的績效中。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We sell containerboard and corrugated products to approximately 12,000 customers in approximately 27,000 locations. About 70% of our corrugated products sales are to regional and local accounts, which are broadly diversified across industries and geographic locations. The remaining 30% of our corrugated products customer base consists primarily of national accounts that have multiple locations and are served by a number of PCA plants. No single customer exceeds 10% of segment sales.","zh":"我們向約 27,000 個地點的約 12,000 名客戶銷售箱板紙和瓦楞紙產品。我們約 70% 的瓦楞紙產品銷售面向區域和本地客戶，這些客戶廣泛分佈於各個行業和地理位置。我們剩餘 30% 的瓦楞紙產品客戶群主要由擁有多個地點並由多家 PCA 工廠提供服務的國民客戶組成。沒有一個客戶超過細分市場銷售額的 10%。"},{"en":"The primary end-use markets in the United States for corrugated products are shown below as reported in the 2024 Fibre Box Association annual report:","zh":"根據纖維箱協會 2024 年年度報告，美國瓦楞紙產品的主要最終用途市場如下所示："}],"competition":[{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, we were the third largest producer of containerboard products in North America, according to industry sources and our own estimates. According to industry sources, corrugated products are produced by about 370 U.S. companies operating approximately 1,080 plants. The primary basis for competition for most of our packaging products includes quality, service, price, product design, and innovation. Most corrugated products are manufactured to the customer's specifications. Corrugated producers generally sell within a 150-mile radius of their plants and compete with other corrugated producers in their local region. Competition in our corrugated products operations tends to be regional, although we also face competition from competitors with significant national account presence.","zh":"根據產業消息來源和我們自己的估計，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們是北美第三大箱板紙產品生產商。據業內人士稱，瓦楞紙產品由大約 370 家美國公司生產，經營約 1,080 家工廠。我們大多數包裝產品的主要競爭基礎包括品質、服務、價格、產品設計和創新。大多數的瓦楞紙產品都是依照客戶的規格製造。瓦楞紙生產商通常在其工廠 150 英里半徑內進行銷售，並與當地其他瓦楞紙生產商競爭。我們的瓦楞紙產品業務的競爭往往是區域性的，儘管我們也面臨著來自在全國範圍內佔有重要地位的競爭對手的競爭。"},{"en":"On a national level, our primary competitors are International Paper, Smurfit WestRock, Georgia-Pacific LLC, and Pratt Industries. However, with our strategic focus on regional and local accounts, we also compete with many smaller, independent producers.","zh":"在全國範圍內，我們的主要競爭對手是國際紙業、Smurfit WestRock、Georgia-Pacific LLC 和 Pratt Industries。然而，由於我們的策略重點是區域和本地客戶，我們也與許多較小的獨立生產商競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Packaging","val":8293900000,"zh":"包裝"},{"name":"Paper","val":615400000,"zh":"紙"}],"total":8989300000}},"peers":["AVY","IEX","RJF","ALLE","MTD"]}}